cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cf-crawl: Crawl and Scrape Websites with the Cloudflare Browser Rendering API"
version: 4.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-04"
abstract: >-
  A TypeScript command-line tool over the Cloudflare Browser Rendering API and
  Workers AI tomarkdown. It runs asynchronous site crawls; synchronous
  single-page operations that scrape elements, return markdown, rendered HTML,
  links, structured JSON, PDFs, screenshots and snapshots; and conversion of
  local files to markdown.
authors:
